{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>For there was relief.</b> Even though the harm did not cease entirely — for the stench of the land remained, and the frogs remained in the river, still causing harm that day." "<b>And he hardened his heart.</b> He exerted himself against his nature, so as not to fear the remaining frogs and to endure the evil of the stench, in order that he would not heed the voice of the blessed El."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:48.695973814Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}